## Program Learning Outcomes

Students completing this program will be able to:

- Demonstrate knowledge of the Old and New Testaments.
- Apply foundational principles of biblical interpretation.
- Understand essential Christian theological doctrines.
- Explain the biblical foundations of Pentecostal–Charismatic theology.
- Recognize the ministry and empowerment of the Holy Spirit.
- Communicate biblical truths effectively in Christian ministry.
